    "hide_share_and_remix": "true",
    "long_instructions": "**Do This**\r\n\r\nThis page has three problems. Fix each one in the right file.\r\n\r\n1.  The heading has a typo.\r\n2.  The button is gray. Make it pink.\r\n3.  The button’s message says “Error.” Change it to “Booked!”\r\n\r\nCheck the preview after each fix.",
